{"suttaId":"tha-ap542","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-ii","vriCode":"s0510m2.mul","paras":[4856,4969],"vripara":"327"},"segments":{"tha-ap542:0.3":"Mogharājattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap542:1.1":"“Padumuttaro nāma jino, sabbalokavidū muni;","tha-ap542:1.3":"Ito satasahassamhi, kappe uppajji cakkhumā.","tha-ap542:2.1":"“Ovādako viññāpako, tārako sabbapāṇinaṃ;","tha-ap542:2.3":"Desanākusalo buddho, tāresi janataṃ bahuṃ.","tha-ap542:3.1":"“Anukampako kāruṇiko, hitesī sabbapāṇinaṃ;","tha-ap542:3.3":"Sampatte titthiye sabbe, pañcasīle patiṭṭhapi.","tha-ap542:4.1":"“Evaṃ nirākulaṃ āsi, suññataṃ titthiyehi ca;","tha-ap542:4.3":"Vicittaṃ arahantehi, vasībhūtehi tādibhi.","tha-ap542:5.1":"“Ratanānaṭṭhapaññāsaṃ, uggato so mahāmuni;","tha-ap542:5.3":"Kañcanagghiyasaṅkāso, bāttiṃsavaralakkhaṇo.","tha-ap542:6.1":"“Vassasatasahassāni, āyu vijjati tāvade;","tha-ap542:6.3":"Tāvatā tiṭṭhamāno so, tāresi janataṃ bahuṃ.","tha-ap542:7.1":"“Tadāhaṃ haṃsavatiyaṃ, kule aññatare ahuṃ;","tha-ap542:7.3":"Parakammāyane yutto, natthi me kiñci saṃdhanaṃ.","tha-ap542:8.1":"“Paṭikkamanasālāyaṃ, vasanto katabhūmiyaṃ;","tha-ap542:8.3":"Aggiṃ ujjālayiṃ tattha, daḷhaṃ kaṇhāsi sā [kaṇhā siyā (sī. pī.), ḍayhakaṇhā silā (syā.)] hī.","tha-ap542:9.1":"“Tadā parisatiṃ nātho, catusaccapakāsako;","tha-ap542:9.3":"Sāvakaṃ sampakittesi, lūkhacīvaradhārakaṃ.","tha-ap542:10.1":"“Tassa tamhi guṇe tuṭṭho, paṇipacca [patipajja (syā.)] tathāgataṃ;","tha-ap542:10.3":"Lūkhacīvaradhāraggaṃ, patthayiṃ ṭhānamuttamaṃ.","tha-ap542:11.1":"“Tadā avoca bhagavā, sāvake padumuttaro;","tha-ap542:11.3":"‘Passathetaṃ purisakaṃ, kucelaṃ tanudehakaṃ.","tha-ap542:12.1":"“‘Pītippasannavadanaṃ, saddhādhanasamanvitaṃ [saddhāsnehasamanvataṃ (ka.)];","tha-ap542:12.3":"Udaggatanujaṃ haṭṭhaṃ, acalaṃ sālapiṇḍitaṃ.","tha-ap542:13.1":"“‘Eso pattheti taṃ ṭhānaṃ, saccasenassa bhikkhuno;","tha-ap542:13.3":"Lūkhacīvaradhārissa, tassa vaṇṇasitāsayo [vaṇṇagatāsayo (sī. syā. pī.)].","tha-ap542:14.1":"“Taṃ sutvā mudito hutvā, nipacca sirasā jinaṃ;","tha-ap542:14.3":"Yāvajīvaṃ subhaṃ kammaṃ, karitvā jinasāsane.","tha-ap542:15.1":"“Tena kammena sukatena, cetanāpaṇidhīhi ca;","tha-ap542:15.3":"Jahitvā mānusaṃ dehaṃ, tāvatiṃsūpago ahaṃ.","tha-ap542:16.1":"“Paṭikkamanasālāyaṃ, bhūmidāhakakammunā;","tha-ap542:16.3":"Samasahassaṃ niraye, adayhiṃ vedanāṭṭito.","tha-ap542:17.1":"“Tena kammāvasesena, pañca jātisatānihaṃ;","tha-ap542:17.3":"Manusso kulajo hutvā, jātiyā lakkhaṇaṅkito.","tha-ap542:18.1":"“Pañca jātisatāneva, kuṭṭharogasamappito;","tha-ap542:18.3":"Mahādukkhaṃ anubhaviṃ, tassa kammassa vāhasā.","tha-ap542:19.1":"“Imasmiṃ bhaddake kappe, upariṭṭhaṃ yasassinaṃ;","tha-ap542:19.3":"Piṇḍapātena tappesiṃ, pasannamānaso ahaṃ.","tha-ap542:20.1":"“Tena kammavisesena, cetanāpaṇidhīhi ca;","tha-ap542:20.3":"Jahitvā mānusaṃ dehaṃ, tāvatiṃsamagacchahaṃ.","tha-ap542:21.1":"“Pacchime bhave sampatte, ajāyiṃ khattiye kule;","tha-ap542:21.3":"Pituno accayenāhaṃ, mahārajjasamappito.","tha-ap542:22.1":"“Kuṭṭharogādhibhūtohaṃ, na ratiṃ na sukhaṃ labhe;","tha-ap542:22.3":"Moghaṃ rajjaṃ sukhaṃ yasmā, mogharājā tato ahaṃ.","tha-ap542:23.1":"“Kāyassa dosaṃ disvāna, pabbajiṃ anagāriyaṃ;","tha-ap542:23.3":"Bāvarissa dijaggassa, sissattaṃ ajjhupāgamiṃ.","tha-ap542:24.1":"“Mahatā parivārena, upecca naranāyakaṃ;","tha-ap542:24.3":"Apucchiṃ nipuṇaṃ pañhaṃ, taṃ vīraṃ vādisūdanaṃ.","tha-ap542:25.1":"“‘Ayaṃ loko paro loko, brahmaloko sadevako;","tha-ap542:25.3":"Diṭṭhiṃ no [diṭṭhā no (sī.), diṭṭhaṃ no (pī.), diṭṭhiṃ te (syā.)] nābhijānāmi, gotamassa yasassino.","tha-ap542:26.1":"“‘Evābhikkantadassāviṃ, atthi pañhena āgamaṃ;","tha-ap542:26.3":"Kathaṃ lokaṃ avekkhantaṃ, maccurājā na passati’.","tha-ap542:27.1":"“‘Suññato lokaṃ avekkhassu, mogharāja sadā sato;","tha-ap542:27.3":"Attānudiṭṭhiṃ uhacca, evaṃ maccutaro siyā.","tha-ap542:28.1":"“‘Evaṃ lokaṃ avekkhantaṃ, maccurājā na passati’;","tha-ap542:28.3":"Iti maṃ abhaṇi buddho, sabbarogatikicchako.","tha-ap542:29.1":"“Saha gāthāvasānena, kesamassuvivajjito;","tha-ap542:29.3":"Kāsāvavatthavasano, āsiṃ bhikkhu tathārahā.","tha-ap542:30.1":"“Saṅghikesu vihāresu, na vasiṃ rogapīḷito;","tha-ap542:30.3":"Mā vihāro padussīti, vātarogehi pīḷito [vācāyābhisupīḷito (syā. pī.), vātarogī supīḷito (ka.)].","tha-ap542:31.1":"“Saṅkārakūṭā āhitvā, susānā rathikāhi ca;","tha-ap542:31.3":"Tato saṅghāṭiṃ karitvā, dhārayiṃ lūkhacīvaraṃ.","tha-ap542:32.1":"“Mahābhisakko tasmiṃ me, guṇe tuṭṭho vināyako;","tha-ap542:32.3":"Lūkhacīvaradhārīnaṃ, etadagge ṭhapesi maṃ.","tha-ap542:33.1":"“Puññapāpaparikkhīṇo, sabbarogavivajjito;","tha-ap542:33.3":"Sikhīva anupādāno, nibbāyissamanāsavo.","tha-ap542:34.1":"“Kilesā jhāpitā mayhaṃ … pe … viharāmi anāsavo.","tha-ap542:35.1":"“Svāgataṃ vata me āsi … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ.","tha-ap542:36.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap542:37.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā mogharājā thero imā gāthāyo Abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap542:38.1":"Mogharājattherassāpadānaṃ dasamaṃ.","tha-ap542:39.1":"Kaccāyanavaggo catupaññāsamo.","tha-ap542:40.1":"Tassuddānaṃ –","tha-ap542:41.1":"Kaccāno vakkalī thero, mahākappinasavhayo;","tha-ap542:41.3":"Dabbo kumāranāmo ca, bāhiyo koṭṭhiko vasī.","tha-ap542:42.1":"Uruveḷakassapo rādho, mogharājā ca paṇḍito;","tha-ap542:42.3":"Tīṇi gāthāsatānettha, bāsaṭṭhi ceva piṇḍitā."},"attha":null,"tika":null}
